<title>BRAZIL: Brazil March 21 coffee regs 3.53 mln bags to May.</title>
<headline>Brazil March 21 coffee regs 3.53 mln bags to May.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee export registrations as of March 21 totaled 3.53 million bags for March, April and May, according to the March 31 bulletin of the Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REGISTRATIONS IN 60-KG BAGS</p>
<p> March		  1,468,562</p>
<p> April		  1,403,368</p>
<p> May			659,335</p>
<p> TOTAL		  3,531,265</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
